<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Pop Culture: Future Aesthetics</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;}
body{color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff00cc,#3333ff);text-align:center;}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:20px;padding:20px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);}
nav a{text-decoration:none;color:white;font-weight:600;}
nav a:hover{color:#ffcc00;}
h1{font-size:3rem;margin-top:60px;animation:pulse 2s infinite alternate;}
@keyframes pulse{to{transform:scale(1.05) rotate(2deg);}}
section{padding:60px 20px;}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:20px;}
.box{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);padding:20px;border-radius:15px;}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;padding:10px 25px;background:#ffcc00;color:#000;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;}
.btn:hover{transform:scale(1.1);}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="#home">Home</a>
  <a href="#trends">Visual Trends</a>
  <a href="#type">Typography</a>
  <a href="#layout">Layouts</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section id="home">
  <h1>THE FUTURE<br>OF POP CULTURE</h1>
  <p>Exploring how pop culture inspires future aesthetics.</p>
  <a href="#trends" class="btn">Discover More</a>
</section>

<section id="trends">
  <h2>Visual Trends</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="box">Vaporwave Revival</div>
    <div class="box">3D Surrealism</div>
    <div class="box">Motion Blur Aesthetic</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="type">
  <h2>Typography & Color</h2>
  <p>Bold sans-serifs and neon gradients define the future look.</p>
</section>

<section id="layout">
  <h2>Layout Innovations</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="box">Asymmetry</div>
    <div class="box">Overlapping Elements</div>
    <div class="box">Flexbox & Grids</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <h2>Reflection</h2>
  <p>Design will evolve with emotion, nostalgia, and interactivity.</p>
</section>

</body>
</html>


